Node ID=1 conversation start
Text=Hold -- hold! Guilhem, down. <A man in a good coat, gone at the elbows, behind two swords and a fire built small to last.> You are the first thing to come up that tunnel on two legs in six weeks. Bernat Sicre, of Toulouse. Cloth.
