Node ID=10 who
Text=A wool man. I buy the clip off the Montaillou shepherds in the spring and I sell it in Barcelona before the fairs, and I have done it eleven years without losing a bale. This year I am eleven years' profit in a hole with two men I am paying by the day and a mule the wolves have already eaten.
Should Have Voiceover=0

