Node ID=20 news
Text=Montaillou is a village of a hundred souls with an Inquisitor sitting in it. They are calling people in one at a time and writing down what they say -- what they eat on a Friday, who they saw on the road, who their mother prayed with. The mayor stands between them and the worst of it, and the mayor is not a young man. That is the news, and I would not carry it if the road were open.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=What do the shepherds say about it?
Go to node ID=21 the woods

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=And the road?
