Node ID=21 the woods
Text=They say what shepherds say. That there is a woman living out past the fields who was there before the church was, and that when a ewe will not take her lamb you go to her and not to the priest. The Inquisitor has heard it too; he has heard everything by now. I sell wool. I did not hear any of it.
