Node ID=22 the road shut
Text=Titans. Great grey things that pull the mountain apart to throw it, and they have the high ground the whole way. And ogres, and the two of them at each other's throats across the only path wide enough for a cart. I have watched a boulder the size of my house come down that road. So I sit here, and my men keep the mouth, and the wolves come and look at us every night and go away again.
Should Have Voiceover=0

