Node ID=23 the bodies
Text=They were here when I crawled in, and they will be here when I am gone. Dry as kindling, every one, and wrapped like a fleece for market. I counted forty in the first week and then I stopped counting. Whatever did that has not been back -- the wolves would not come to the mouth if it had -- and I do not intend to be here when it remembers the address. We keep the fire between us and the dark end, and we do not go down there for any reason at all.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Sensible.
Go to node ID=
Icon=Exit Icon
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=30 peire
Text=<He takes it without a word and goes to the fire.> ...His name is Peire. He took a wolf on his arm the second week and it has not closed since. That was decently done, and I have not got much in me to be decent about lately. Take something off my stock at what it cost me; I will still be ahead of where I was this morning.
Should Have Voiceover=0

