Node ID=40 the road
Text=Open. <He stands, and looks at you, and does not sit down again.> Guilhem! The road is open! ...I will not ask how you know. I have six weeks of paying two men and nothing to show any shepherd in the spring, and I am going before it shuts again. Here -- gold, and a book I took in trade in Foix that I cannot read and you will not sell for less than it is worth. Go carefully up there. I am going carefully down.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Travel well, Bernat.
