------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=50 guilhem
Text=Six weeks of wolves and one of you. Talk to him, not to me -- I am watching the tunnel.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=51 peire
Text=<The second sword sits by the fire with his arm bound in a strip of good cloth. It has been bound a while.>
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=52 peire healed
Text=<He has the colour back in his face, and his sword is across his knees instead of on the ground.> The arm holds. My thanks.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=60 camp cold
Text=<Three sets of boot-prints going east, a burnt-out fire, and the straps they could not carry. The wolves have been over it since and found nothing worth the trouble.>
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=61 the bodies hover
Text=<Bodies, wrapped and stacked against the wall like faggots of wood. Dry, and old. Whatever bound them has not been back in a long time, and the wolves have not been able to get into them.>
Should Have Voiceover=0
